      {
        "author": {
          "login": "GilShoshan94"
        },
        "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
        "body": "Hi @epage,\r\n\r\nI have an issue in the CI because the test I made has the help to wide and I think it wraps. \r\nSee the CI error:\r\n<img width=\"1960\" height=\"1342\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/166931c2-522a-49bb-9d22-a670e3ee432e\" />\r\n\r\nI tried to fix this, by setting `.term_width(usize::MAX)` but it didn't help....\r\n`.term_width(0)` didn't solve it either.\r\n\r\nI am still looking for a solution, in case you see this before I solve it, your help and guidance will be appreciated as always.",
        "createdAt": "2025-07-14T22:09:49Z",
        "id": "IC_kwDOAd3Usc63Dox-",
        "includesCreatedEdit": true,
        "isMinimized": false,
        "minimizedReason": "",
